IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `screa-corporation`

-- Singapore Corporation of Rehabilitative Enterprises Act 1975, ss 2, 4(1), 6(2), 14(2), 15(c), (e), (g), 16(c), (g), (h), (k), 17, 17A, 21, 22, 24 and 35(2) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_singapore-corporation-of-rehabilitative-enterprises-act-1975.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a sentenced prisoner working in a Corporation workshop` MEANS Person WITH
